{"locales":{"en":{"sah6hwikwdh":{"lh_a168_title_html":"HOW TO INSTALL ICE MAKER KIT<br><br>"},"27uz2r2043w":{"lh_a168_title":"ICE MAKER KIT INCLUDES","lh_9wid92_lable":"FEMALE QUICK CONNECT BRASS ADAPTER","lh_9wid92_desc_html":"Eliminate the need to tighten the nut with a wrench tool, just hand twist the built-in wing nut adapter unto your fitting, and push in the tubing then viola, project accomplished!<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_a5w0bb_lable":"UNIVERSAL ADAPTER","lh_a5w0bb_desc_html":"Enjoy a seamless installation process with our all-inclusive package, ensuring you have everything you need at your fingertips. Say goodbye to last-minute runs to the hardware store, as our kit comes complete with all necessary parts for effortless and efficient installation.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_af9ndk_lable_html":"DURABLE &amp; LONG LASTING","lh_af9ndk_desc_html":"All virgin polypropylene quick connectors and tubing are made from NSF certified materials, providing you long lasting usage with no leakage.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"sNCeSoXTZR":{"lh_a168_title_html":"OUR BEST SELLERS<div><br><\/div><div><br><\/div><div><br><\/div>","lh_hpo2th_title_html":"ICEMK2538\/ICEMK2514<br>","lh_hpo2th_des_html":"<h3>USE TO CONNECT EXISTING\u00a0<\/h3><h3>SHUT OFF VALVE<\/h3><br>\n<ul style=\"list-style-position: inside;\">\n<ul style=\"list-style-position: inside;\">\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">White ODx25ft LLDPE tubing<\/li>\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">Quick connect ball valve<\/li>\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">1\/2\" x 3\/8\" Universal adapter tee<\/li>\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">1\/2\" x 3\/8\" reducing nipple<\/li>\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">female quick connector adapter<\/li>\n<\/ul><\/ul><!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_hpo2ti_title":"ROFKIT2514","lh_hpo2ti_des_html":"<h3><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">USE TO CONNECT EXISTING WATER FILTRATION SYSTEM<\/span><\/h3><br>\n<ul style=\"list-style-position: inside;\">\n<ul style=\"list-style-position: inside;\">\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">White 1\/4\" OD x 25 feet LLDPE tubing<\/li>\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">1\/4\" x 1\/4\" quick connect ball valve<\/li>\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">3\/8\" x 3\/8\" x 1\/4\" quick connect tee<\/li>\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">1\/2\" x 3\/8\" reducing nipple<\/li>\n    <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">1\/4\"&nbsp; x 1\/4\" female quick connect<\/li>\n <li style=\"text-align: left;\" data-lh-list=\"\">1\/4\"  quick connect x 3\/8\" stem reduces (2pc)<\/li>\n<\/ul><!--lh-live-editor--><\/ul>"},"ts1zkfhzfh":{"lh_sjlit0_soldout":"Sold out","lh_sjlit0_new":"New","wishlist":"Wishlist","lh_txhi7h_view":"Quick view","lh_f635tz_cart":"Add to cart","lh_3k9wqs_options":"Select options","lh_8hwm_now":"ADD TO CART","lh_hth6t_detail":"VIEW DETAIL","lh_hth6t_more":"VIEW MORE","lh_a168_title":"SHOP ICE MAKER KITS"},"924l0tull9":{"lh_a0z1_title_html":"<div style=\"line-height: 58px;\">     <span style=\"font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: 800; color: #000000;\">ENJOY <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">MET<\/span><\/span>     <span style=\"font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: 800; color: #0587d5;\">PRO<\/span>     <span style=\"font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: 800; color: #000000;\">&nbsp; PRICE<\/span> <\/div>"},"vws6pgwjcd":{"lh_a0z1_title_html":"<span style=\"font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: 800; color: #000000;\">ENJOY MET<\/span>      <span style=\"font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: 800; color: #0587d5;\">PRO<\/span>      <span style=\"font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: 800; color: #000000;\">PRICE<\/span>"},"Irhs1KCA5v":{"lh_a168_title_html":"<div style=\"line-height: 58px;\"> Join  <span style=\"font-size: 1em; font-weight: 800; color: #43dad5;\">MET<\/span><span style=\"font-size: 1em; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">PRO<\/span>  to unlock wholesale pricing!<\/div>","lh_a168_desc_html":"<br> \n<br>\nSave up to 50% off on faucets, filters and ice maker kits. FREE to join and registration takes less than 3 minutes.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_8huk_link":"JOIN MET PRO NOW!"},"l2py1dipvbj":{"title":"CUSTOMERS LOVE OUR ICE MAKER KITS","lh_ahjacp_title":"Living like rich folk!","lh_ahjacp_des_html":"<!--lh-live-editor-->OMGooooodness. Everything you need! Love it! Had my doubts, but everything fit perfectly, long enough tubing, fitting seems sturdy enough... For the first time ever, I have cool filtered water and ice from a refrigerator door ;-) I only had to remove everything from the bottom cabinets, slide the fridge out, slide the oven out, drill holes through the back and bottoms of 6 cabinets, and hook up the fitting under the sink.... and then put everything back LOL Seriously, Thank You for having the correct needs.","lh_ahjacp_mem":"Rick. C.","lh_ahj7ag_title":"Just what I needed","lh_ahj7ag_des_html":"After failing to find what I needed from multiple big box hardware stores I found this item and in 24 hours it was delivered. Installed in about 45 minutes (drilling holes in cabinets and moving my refrigerator to get to back). My only issue was trying to remember which direction the open valve was in (parallel with tube). Added an inline filter and now I have plenty of clean ice.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ahj7ag_mem":"W. Wells","lh_ahj487_title":"Done without plumbers","lh_ahj487_des_html":"I have no real plumbing experience. After having a plumber install a new sink and replace the shutoffs, I realized that the with the price I was charged I could totally screw everything up multiple times and still come out cheaper than the plumbers in my area. So, because the plumbers didn't have the parts to hook my fridge line back up, I watched a couple of videos online, bought this thing, and did it myself. It's been installed now for a month or two. No leaks. Everything works as it should and I'm very happy. Saved myself hundreds of bucks too.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ahj487_mem":"Chandra R.","lh_ahj15y_title":"Easy to install and doesn't feel cheap","lh_ahj15y_des_html":"Easy and doesn't feel cheaply made. That is the hallmark of a good product. Great deal for the money in 2023. Can't say what the price will be in 2024.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ahj15y_mem":"Rob","lh_ahiy3p_title":"Works perfectly","lh_ahiy3p_des_html":"Everything you need comes in the kit. I found a video in YouTube that walks you step by step on installation. We finally have ice and water from out fridge!<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ahiy3p_mem":"Jose Elfego Martinez","lh_ahiv1g_title":"Perfect for my icemaker.","lh_ahiv1g_des_html":"This kit was perfect to install the icemaker\/water dispenser on my new fridge. I'm enjoying the ice and water. Recommended.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ahiv1g_mem":"Texas Reality"}}},"name":"Ice Maker Kit"}
